## 📚 Exemplo Completo de Implementação

### Cenário: Implementar funcionalidade de Produto

#### Passo 1: Criar Domain
```java
// application/core/domain/Product.java
package br.com.fsj.salesplatform.application.core.domain;

import java.math.BigDecimal;

public record Product(
    String id,
    String name,
    BigDecimal price
) {}
```

#### Passo 2: Criar Input Port
```java
// application/ports/in/InsertProductInputPort.java
package br.com.fsj.salesplatform.application.ports.in;

import br.com.fsj.salesplatform.application.core.domain.Product;

public interface InsertProductInputPort {
    Product insert(Product product);
}
```

#### Passo 3: Criar Output Port
```java
// application/ports/out/InsertProductOutputPort.java
package br.com.fsj.salesplatform.application.ports.out;

import br.com.fsj.salesplatform.application.core.domain.Product;

public interface InsertProductOutputPort {
    Product insert(Product product);
}
```

#### Passo 4: Criar Use Case
```java
// application/core/usecase/InsertProductUseCase.java
package br.com.fsj.salesplatform.application.core.usecase;

import br.com.fsj.salesplatform.application.core.domain.Product;
import br.com.fsj.salesplatform.application.ports.in.InsertProductInputPort;
import br.com.fsj.salesplatform.application.ports.out.InsertProductOutputPort;
import org.springframework.stereotype.Service;

@Service
public class InsertProductUseCase implements InsertProductInputPort {

    private final InsertProductOutputPort outputPort;

    public InsertProductUseCase(InsertProductOutputPort outputPort) {
        this.outputPort = outputPort;
    }

    @Override
    public Product insert(Product product) {
        // Validações de negócio aqui
        return this.outputPort.insert(product);
    }
}
```

#### Passo 5: Criar Entity
